 "conventions": {
  "check": "errCode = first failing code in numeric order: 1 |tickSpot - refTick| > band; 2 hi - lo != wTicks; 3 lo or hi not a multiple of spacing; 4 not lo <= tickSpot < hi; 5 not lo <= refTick < hi; 0 ok. The vault maps 1 Fence, 2 Width, 3 Alignment, 4 and 5 NotContained.",
  "size": "L = getLiquidityForAmounts(sqrtSpot, sqrtAt(lo), sqrtAt(hi), idle0, idle1) - (L/1e9 + 1), floored at 0; after = idle minus the v4 add amounts of L at sqrtSpot (roundUp = true); deltaAfter = min(WAD, positionValue(sqrtRef)*WAD / NAV(sqrtRef)) of `after` (0 when NAV = 0). deltaAfter < DELTA_MIN (0.5 WAD) means the vault reverts DeltaMin. Legs saturate at type(uint128).max (spot one unit inside an edge, case token1-edge-saturated-leg).",
  "fields": "Placement.check in {lo, hi, tickSpot, refTick, band, wTicks, spacing} out {errCode}; Placement.size in {idle, lo, hi, sqrtSpot, sqrtRef} out {L, after, deltaAfter}; idle/after are Holdings {idle0, idle1, L, lo, hi}."
 },
